# VTID-03763 — commands run during investigation and verification

## Investigation (read-only, live oasis_events tracing)

Queried live `oasis_events` for the reporting user's session (via Supabase
MCP, read-only SELECT) to confirm the guided-topic candidate's
wake-brief-ranking outcome. Two independent signals agreed the field was
absent server-side:
  - `orb.livekit.next_action.*` topic rows showed `all_sources_skipped` —
    `guided_topic_narration` was never even attempted for the failing tap.
  - `live-session-controller.ts`'s `isGuidedTopicSession` fast-bootstrap
    check (requires `typeof body.guided_topic_id === 'string' && !!...`)
    was false for that session — it took the slow bootstrap path
    (context_pack.built / memory.social.context_built /
    memory.orchestrator.context_built / llm.call.started:memory all fired),
    which only happens when guided_topic_id is genuinely absent from the
    raw request body.

Ruled out via static code reading + grep before landing on the real root
cause:
  - Rapid re-tap race — user explicitly confirmed "I waited" between taps.
  - `updateContext()`'s `guided_topic_id` clobber path — confirmed dead via
    `grep -n "guided_topic_id" src/hooks/useOrbVoiceWidget.ts`; the sole
    `orb.updateContext(...)` call site never passes that field.

Root cause confirmed by reading `orb-widget.js`'s `_waitForAudioEnd` IIFE
(the `case 'turn_complete':` handler) end-to-end, and grepping for every
other `setTimeout`-chained self-recursive poll using the same
`if (!_s.active) return;` staleness pattern:
  grep -n "function _waitForGoodbyeEnd\|function _waitForNavReady\|_s\.active = true\|_sessionGeneration" services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/orb-widget.js

## Implementation

Edits to `services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/orb-widget.js`:
  - Added `_sessionGeneration: 0` to the initial `_s` state object.
  - Added `_s._sessionGeneration++;` immediately after both
    `_s.active = true;` assignments (SSE session-start success handler,
    WS session-start success handler).
  - Wrapped `_waitForAudioEnd`, `_waitForGoodbyeEnd`, and `_waitForNavReady`
    each in an outer `(function (myGen) { ... })(_s._sessionGeneration);`
    IIFE, and added `if (_s._sessionGeneration !== myGen) return;` as the
    first statement of every `setTimeout` callback inside them (including
    the second, nested grace-period `setTimeout` in the latter two).
  - Added `var myGen = _s._sessionGeneration;` at the top of
    `_endGuidedTopicTeaching(topicId, reason)` and the same guard as the
    first statement of both its `setTimeout` callbacks.

Edits to `exafyltd/vitana-v1`:
  - `src/hooks/useOrbVoiceWidget.ts`: added `onGuidedTopicTeachingEnd` to
    both `navOpts` object literals (main init effect, auth-change reinit
    effect), dispatching `window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(
    "vitana:guided-topic-teaching-complete", {detail:{topicId, reason}}))`.
  - `src/components/journey/GuidedJourneyCatalog.tsx`: added a `useEffect`
    (before the component's loading/error early returns, so hook order
    stays stable) that listens for `vitana:guided-topic-teaching-complete`
    on `window` and calls `completePractice(topicId)` on receipt, mirroring
    `markPracticeDone`'s invalidate + toast pattern.

