## Branch note

The designated branch for this session (`claude/my-journey-catalog-multilingual-qrwxng`,
both repos) was found to contain only already-merged history in each repo
(its own single "ahead" commit's content was confirmed present on `main`
under a different SHA — a squash-merge artifact) — 1 ahead / 60 behind in
vitana-platform, 1 ahead / 7611 behind in vitana-v1. Per this session's
standing instructions for that situation, both branches were reset to their
respective `origin/main` (`git reset --hard origin/main`, safe since no
unmerged content was lost — verified via `git merge-base --is-ancestor` and
matching commit content by title/diff before resetting) and this VTID's
changes were reapplied on top of the fresh base. Both repos' diffs applied
cleanly (`git apply --check`) with no conflicts.
